        " أَكُونُ خَلْفَ اَلْإِمَامِ وَ هُوَ يَجْهَرُ بِالْقِرَاءَةِ فَأَدْعُو وَ أَتَعَوَّذُ قَالَ «نَعَمْ فَادْعُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1209 - Abu al-Maghra' Humayd ibn al-Muthanna said:\n\"I was with Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) when Hafs al-Kalbi asked him:\n\"When I am behind the Imam and he is reciting aloud, may I make supplications and seek refuge (in Allah (swt))?\"\nImam (as) said: \"Yes, you may supplicate.\""
        ]
      }
